control: A process refuses the environment the database driver and every component it hosts refuse, before its configuration is read
removes: the refusals run after the configuration is read, so a start whose environment sets a refused variable reads its configuration first and reports its file's error instead
packages: ./process/host
tests: TestTheEnvironmentIsRefusedBeforeTheConfigurationIsRead/until_stopped/PGPASSWORD=s3cret TestTheEnvironmentIsRefusedBeforeTheConfigurationIsRead/until_stopped/PGPASSWORD= TestTheEnvironmentIsRefusedBeforeTheConfigurationIsRead/until_stopped/PGSSLPASSWORD= TestTheEnvironmentIsRefusedBeforeTheConfigurationIsRead/until_stopped/COMPONENTDEBUG=
scheduled-count: no

